                        "review": "Handball simulator\n\n✅Multiple game modes\n✅Replays available\n✅Career mode\n✅Arge selection of national team and club teams\n✅Various difficulty modes\n\n❌Too high a price for this game (may be on sale)\n❌Poor controls\n❌Lack of licenses for real players\n❌Poor artificial intelligence, especially for goalkeepers\n❌Fans dont react to events on the pitch; it looks very artificial\n\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [strike] Very Bad [/strike] , [b] Bad [/b] , [strike] Decent [/strike] , [strike] Good [/strike] , [strike] Very good [/strike] , [strike] Excellent [/strike] , [strike] Masterpiece [/strike]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. Im happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer.\n",
